  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Material humanitarian aid Bosna and Herzegovina 2017_2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Materi&#xe1;lna HP Bosna a Hercegovina 2017_2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Material humanitarian aid provided by the Ecumenical Pastoral Service of the Armed Forces of &#xa0;the Slovak Republic in 2017 to the Ministry of Interior of BaH. Tha material aid was addressed to the people with difficult living conditions and composed of: clothing and hygienic packages.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Donors: Ecumenical Pastoral Headquarter of Armed Forces of the Slovak Republic, Ministry of Interior of the Slovak Republic, ECAV.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Materi&#xe1;lna humanit&#xe1;rna pomoc poskytnut&#xe1; &#xda;stred&#xed;m ekumenickej pastora&#x10d;nej slu&#x17e;by Ozbrojen&#xfd;ch s&#xed;l SR v roku 2017 pre Ministerstvo vn&#xfa;tra BaH. ,ateri&#xe1;l bol ur&#x10d;en&#xfd; na pomoc &#x13e;u&#x10f;om v &#x165;a&#x17e;k&#xfd;ch existen&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch podmienkach a pozost&#xe1;val z:&#xa0;zbierka &#x161;atstva (cca 6 m3, 300 ks hygienick&#xfd;ch bal&#xed;&#x10d;kov (prac&#xed; pr&#xe1;&#x161;ok 300 g, zubn&#xe1; kefka, zubn&#xe1; pasta 100 ml, sprchov&#xfd; g&#xe9;l 500 ml, mydlo 100 g, dezinfek&#x10d;n&#xe9; obr&#xfa;sky, dezinfek&#x10d;n&#xfd; g&#xe9;l na ruky).&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Donor: &#xda;stredie ekumenickej pastora&#x10d;nej slu&#x17e;by v OS SR a OZ SR, Ministerstvo vn&#xfa;tra SR, Evanjelick&#xe1; diakonia ECAV na Slovensku.&lt;br /&gt;Miesto ofici&#xe1;lneho aktu odovzdania a prevzatia pomoci:&#xa0;&#x10c;erven&#xfd; kr&#xed;&#x17e; Kantona Sarajevo 14.12.2017.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
